locally adapted disease-resistant varieties to reduce inoculum pressure where feasible. Weather and crop susceptibility can change risk. This context does not authorize a crop-protection action, rate, or timing; any such action must use current PMRA-authorized information and current Manitoba decision support.","title":"Manitoba 2026 cereal disease observation and prevention context"}
