ootwear, water, animals, or field traffic as a potential pathway between sites. Limiting soil movement, careful sanitation, crop sequence, and appropriate variety choice are complementary risk-reduction concepts. This source does not define compliance duties, a sanitation method, a rotation interval, or a chemical intervention.","title":"Manitoba 2026 canola clubroot recognition and soil-movement context"}
